sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Run as Runner/Verifier
  participant Miner as Failure Miner
  participant Tree as 14-Step Root Cause
  participant KB as Knowledge Candidate
  participant Repair as Repair Writer
  participant Rev as Reviewer
  participant Gate as Completion Gate
  participant Human
  Run->>Miner: failed run + evidence graph
  Miner->>Tree: classify failure
  alt 1-12 类：测试逻辑/环境/设备/断言
    Tree-->>Repair: repair hypothesis
    Repair->>Rev: diff + evidence + risk
    Rev-->>Run: approved repair
    Run->>Run: re-run after fix
  else 13/14 类：需求矛盾或固件真实不满足
    Tree->>Gate: eligible final FAIL
    Gate->>Human: report + evidence
  end
  Miner->>KB: write candidate failure case
  KB-->>Gate: candidate ids
  Note over Tree,Gate: 只有 13/14 类可保留最终 FAIL；其余必须先修复并重跑
